            <tr><td>5 · Local tokenizer inspection and interactive token tool</td><td>Implemented</td><td>Shown on compatible public models</td></tr>
            <tr><td>6a · Browser Transformers.js, local WASM, WebGPU/WASM</td><td>Implemented</td><td>User device pays the compute cost</td></tr>
            <tr><td>6b · Persistent llama.cpp GGUF run, chat, warm reuse, status, unload, settings, and token statistics</td><td>Implemented</td><td>Operator runtime hardware required</td></tr>
            <tr><td>7 · vLLM and SGLang high-throughput serving</td><td>Reviewed self-host setup guidance</td><td>Super ii-managed hosting only after dedicated funded GPU capacity</td></tr>
